{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122766","id":4349770962,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA0Q80g","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122766","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122766.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122766.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122766","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122766/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122766/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122766/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/793570ed5a2881be1b6b635c7eebcff78c925ffa","number":122766,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[.NET]: Embed custom types as grouped properties","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/438\r\n- Closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/997\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nCurrently just a proof of concept.\r\n\r\nNot sure if there is interest for this, seeing as structs are being hypothetically worked on, but I just had an idea that I thought is possible with already existing systems. Should be even more lightweight than hypothetical structs, seeing that these properties don't actually exist :V\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1786\" height=\"990\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/334990e3-2b83-4ce7-9c22-2f93a3e81cb9\" />\r\n\r\n## Limitations\r\n\r\n- You can't use `[ExportEmbed]` in the middle of the group or a subgroup (well you can if you like seeing broken grouping I guess).\r\n- Pretty sure `[ExportCategory]` won't work (breaks `PROPERTY_HINT_GROUP_ENABLE` that is used as null set).\r\n- Treats `[ExportGroup]` as `[ExportSubgroup]` inside the embedded class, otherwise it was too messy.\r\n- If you null a class value in `[Tool]` script , you won't be able to restore its values.\r\n- Bloat of properties, embedded types work by embedding properties as part of the Godot Object.\r\n\r\nNo AI used.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state